    <step order="4">Update any exhaustive `CommunicationType` switch that would silently mis-handle `Message`, and the corresponding tests in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/` (root §10 bullet 6). If no such site exists, note that (the dispatcher resolves the impl in 020, not here).</step>
